From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Phononenom <64574232+Phononenom@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Mon, 23 Nov 2026 12:44:59 -0600
Subject: [PATCH] Playtendoh's Switch 2 side: the JIT's tables split, and its
 memory waits

The JIT's LocationTable is split in 16 parts for blocks and sites (one table no longer needs one large
block), its allocator and asserts follow, and its fast paths and aliases are kept in step.

From these commits (oldest first):
- 2026-11-17 Playtendoh's Switch 2 side: the shared JIT and the fastmem window on Lichii 907d54757b
- 2026-11-19 Playtendoh's Switch 2 side: the JIT starts its cache over when code memory runs out
- 2026-11-20 Playtendoh's Switch 2 side: the JIT starts its cache over when its block tables cannot grow
- 2026-11-22 Playtendoh's Switch 2 side: the shared JIT's block and link tables split in 16
